---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
---
<Page title="Printable checklists for importing and listing" description="Printable seller checklists for before you order, before goods ship, before customs entry and before you list, each linked to the guide behind the step." kicker="Tools" photo="hub-tools" lede="Use them as a pre-flight check. Each item links to the guide that explains the rule behind it; tick boxes stay on your screen only." trail={[{ label: 'Tools', href: '/tools/' }]}>
  <Checklist title="Before you place a purchase order" items={['Confirm who will be the importer of record and whether a customs bond is needed (see the importer-of-record and customs bond guides).', 'Find the HTS classification and general duty rate for the product.', 'Check whether additional duties apply to the product and its country of origin.', 'Check whether the product falls within an antidumping or countervailing duty order.', 'Confirm the country of origin and how the product and its packaging will be marked.', 'Check whether the product needs a certificate of conformity or third-party testing.', 'Check whether any component (for example a lithium battery) makes the shipment hazardous material.']} />
  <Checklist title="Before the goods ship" items={['Estimate duty and federal entry fees with the duty estimator.', 'Agree on documents: commercial invoice, packing list, certificate where required.', 'Confirm marking is on the goods and on the containers that reach the buyer.', 'Decide whether the shipment will move on an informal or formal entry.', 'Check current low-value shipment rules if shipping parcels directly.']} />
  <Checklist title="Before you list" items={['Run the price through the profit calculator with the platform\'s current fee rate.', 'Compare fees on other platforms with the fee comparison tool.', 'Confirm review requests follow the federal rule on consumer reviews.', 'Record the landed cost per unit for inventory and cost of goods sold.']} />
  <p>Explanations: <a href="/guides/incoterms-who-is-importer/">importer of record</a> · <a href="/guides/customs-bonds/">customs bonds</a> · <a href="/guides/hts-classification-basics/">classification</a> · <a href="/guides/tariff-stack-2026/">additional duties</a> · <a href="/guides/antidumping-duties/">AD/CVD</a> · <a href="/guides/origin-marking-requirements/">marking</a> · <a href="/guides/us-product-compliance/">certificates</a> · <a href="/guides/hazmat-dangerous-goods/">hazmat</a> · <a href="/guides/entry-type-11-vs-01/">entry types</a> · <a href="/guides/de-minimis-suspension-2026/">de minimis</a> · <a href="/guides/review-manipulation-risk/">reviews</a> · <a href="/guides/accrual-accounting-cogs/">COGS</a>.</p>
</Page>
